== the envelope
not an object
  p.plan.json is not a JSON object.
a wrong format
  p.plan.json: format is "pokesim-story-plan/1", not gamepilot-checkpoint/1.
no execution
  p.plan.json: execution is missing.
an unknown envelope field
  p.plan.json: x is not a known field.
no checkpoint
  p.plan.json: checkpoint is missing.
an unknown checkpoint field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.x is not a known field.
an empty checkpoint id
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.id is empty.
no events
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events is missing.
events not a list
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events is not an array.
== events
an unknown event field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].x is not a known field.
an event without an id
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].id is missing.
an empty event id
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].id is empty.
an event without a kind
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].kind is missing.
an unknown kind
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].kind "dance" is not a built-in event kind.
a repeated event id
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[1].id "e" repeats events[0].
args not an object
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args is not a JSON object.
skip_if not a list
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].skip_if is not a list of strings.
once_per_save not true or false
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].once_per_save is not true or false.
a game_action without its action
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].action is missing: a game_action names its action.
a declared_after with a map and a place
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].declared_after has a "map" or a "place", not both or neither.
a declared_after tile not a pair
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].declared_after.tiles[0] is not [x, y].
== the engine's story actions
talk with an arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.who is not a known field.
scene with an arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.long is not a known field.
save with an arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.slot is not a known field.
answer with an unknown arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.loud is not a known field.
answer not true or false
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.yes is not true or false.
== the Pokémon actions
new_game with an arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.name is not a known field.
game_settings with an arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.fast is not a known field.
heal with an arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.where is not a known field.
route without a target
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target is missing.
route with an unknown arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.run is not a known field.
route fight_wild not true or false
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.fight_wild is not true or false.
route target with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target.spot is not a known field.
route target without a map
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target.map is missing.
route target tiles not a list
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target.tiles is not an array.
route target tile not a pair
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target.tiles[0] is not [x, y].
route target facing not a direction
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target.facing "up" is not north, east, south or west.
ready with fight_wild
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.fight_wild is not a known field.
ready without a target
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.target is missing.
legs without legs
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.legs is missing.
legs not a list
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.legs is not an array.
a leg without tiles
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.legs[0].tiles is missing.
a leg with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.legs[0].run is not a known field.
a leg direction not a direction
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.legs[0].direction "up" is not north, east, south or west.
step without a direction
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.direction is missing.
step direction not a direction
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.direction "up" is not north, east, south or west.
battle may_lose not true or false
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.may_lose is not true or false.
battle with an unknown arg
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.flee is not a known field.
train without battles
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.battles is missing.
train battles not a number
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.battles is not an integer.
shop without items
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.items is missing.
a shop item without a quantity
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.items[0].quantity is missing.
a shop item with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].args.items[0].price is not a known field.
== postconditions
an unknown postcondition
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.badges is not a known field.
postconditions not an object
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions is not a JSON object.
a position with a place
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.position.place is not a known field.
a position without a map
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.position.map is missing.
a position with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.position.heading is not a known field.
party and party_includes
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.party and party_includes: one or the other, not both.
party_slots with party
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.party_slots goes with party_includes, not party.
a party slot past six
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.party_slots[0].slot 7 is not a party slot (1-6).
a party slot with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.party_slots[0].level is not a known field.
party not a list of names
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.party[0] is not a string.
an item with no count
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.items[0]: give one of quantity, gained, used, at_least.
an item with two counts
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.items[0]: give one of quantity, gained, used, at_least.
an item with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.items[0].x is not a known field.
coins not a number or an object
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.coins is not a number or a JSON object.
coins with no count
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.coins: give one of exactly, gained, used, at_least.
coins with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.coins.x is not a known field.
money with neither a range nor spent
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money: give min and max, or spent.
money spent and a range
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money: give min and max, or spent, not both.
money min above max
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money.min 5 is above max 4.
money with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money.x is not a known field.
flags not a list
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.flags is not a list of strings.
knows without moves
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.knows[0].moves is missing.
a level without its min
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.levels[0].min is missing.
a mark no party shows
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.marks: berry is not held_item, mail or none.
== several bad fields
bad items, coins and money
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money: give min and max, or spent.
bad coins and money
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money: give min and max, or spent.
bad items and coins
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.coins: give one of exactly, gained, used, at_least.
a bad position and marks
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.marks: berry is not held_item, mail or none.
a bad party and levels
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.levels[0].min is missing.
an unknown field and a bad money
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.badges is not a known field.
a bad event and bad postconditions
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.postconditions.money: give min and max, or spent.
a bad kind and a bad declared_after
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].declared_after has a "map" or a "place", not both or neither.
a bad arg and a bad skip_if
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.events[0].skip_if is not a list of strings.
== repeats and retries
a repeat without until
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.repeat.until is missing.
a repeat below one round
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.repeat.max_rounds is 0, not 1 or more.
a repeat goal with an unknown field
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.repeat.until.badges is not a known field.
negative retries
  p.plan.json: checkpoint.metadata.retries is -1, not 0 or more.
